ted_at":"2026-11-12T04:30:00Z"},{"id":738061554,"node_id":"RA_kwDONhAAJs4r_ezy","name":"jabridge_1.7.0_source.tar.gz.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"login":"Watchdog0x","id":84445039,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0NDQ1MDM5","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":95,"digest":"sha256:901d40e8f661b69345e8a7b3d82aa41b7685ab3c22634d6ff875bc39d9a55968","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-11-12T04:30:00Z","updated_at":"2026-11-12T04:30:00Z"},{"id":738061558,"node_id":"RA_kwDONhAAJs4r_ez2","name":"jabridge_1.7.0_source.tar.gz.sig","label":"","uploader":{"login":"Watchdog0x","id":84445039,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0NDQ1MDM5","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/pgp-signature","state":"uploaded","size":88,"digest":"sha256:b654b0fc543a57dce034dabaec5be38018eea8cb5d85d1667ffa54763696705c","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-11-12T04:30:00Z","updated_at":"2026-11-12T04:30:00Z"},{"id":738061517,"node_id":"RA_kwDONhAAJs4r_ezN","name":"SHA256SUMS","label":"","uploader":{"login":"Watchdog0x","id":84445039,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0NDQ1MDM5","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":295,"digest":"sha256:5f8a022a74de90fc278480801c30d395c2dbf21e85643acd1a8995ec251de9a1","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-11-12T04:29:59Z","updated_at":"2026-11-12T04:29:59Z"}],"body":"Jabridge 1.7.0\n\nDebug reports now show which headset or base component did not answer. Docking advice is clearer when the headset is already connected.\n\nThe separate Engage 75 test handles update-mode USB devices that omit a serial number. A new attempt checks the original device and firmware again and keeps earlier records and result files.\n\nThe legacy Engage 75 flow remains off in normal builds while hardware testing continues. The test download is shared separately in [#62](https://github.com/Watchdog0x/jabridge/issues/62).\n\nThanks @mtalexan for the logs and testing.\n\nUpdate the app with:\n\n```sh\njabridge update\n```\n\nDevice firmware is updated separately from the app.\n","mentions_count":1}
